 "text": "Hey there, how are you feeling? That's a great age for fun outings. Have you thought about a zoo or an amusement park? Nice to give him a real world career to aim at. Which one would you pick? pilot, engineer, or doctor? Pilots still fly, they just have fewer flights. Engineers are everywhere, and doctors see patients everywhere. Then an engineer or doctor would see lots of different foods on their jobs. A pilot might only fly on flights with food included. Also think about opening hours. Somemountable day for a young child might be challenging.",
